abstract: "Clock Explorer brings together segmentation-clock experiments across species and redraws kymographs from published data and time-lapse videos in a consistent visual format. Explore mouse, zebrafish, medaka and human stem-cell models side by side to compare oscillations, traveling waves and their arrest during somite formation. The goal is to make shared patterns and species-specific differences easier to see and use as a reference for modeling."
